sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Victim as Trauma Victim (Unconscious)
    actor Bystander as Good Samaritan Bystander
    actor Paramedic as Certified Paramedic / EMT
    participant Cam as Mobile Camera / Scanner
    participant Edge as PRANA Edge Gateway (Cloudflare/Next.js)
    participant Engine as QR Cryptographic Engine
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant SMS as Fast2SMS Gateway
    actor Kin as Emergency Contact (Next of Kin)

    Victim->>Bystander: Displays Physical / Lockscreen PRANA QR Code
    Bystander->>Cam: Scans QR with Native Phone Camera
    Cam->>Edge: HTTPS GET /p/{prana_id} (Unauthenticated Browser Hit)
    Edge->>DB: Query Public Emergency Fields (Blood Group, Critical Flag, Contacts)
    DB-->>Edge: Returns Blood Group, First-Aid Tips, Primary Contact Number
    Edge->>SMS: Asynchronously Trigger Emergency Dispatch Alert
    SMS-->>Kin: SMS: 'ALERT: PRANA QR for Sreeju S scanned at Location Lat/Long'
    Edge-->>Bystander: Renders Red Public First-Aid Card with Direct Dial Button

    Paramedic->>Cam: Opens PRANA Responder Mobile App & Scans QR
    Cam->>Edge: HTTPS POST /api/emergency/verify (PRANA-QR Base45 Ciphertext + JWT)
    Edge->>Engine: Decrypt Payload (X25519 Shared Secret + AES-GCM Tag Verification)
    Engine-->>Edge: Validated Emergency Medical Summary (Codebook Dict Extracted)
    Edge->>DB: INSERT into emergency_access_logs (responder_id, patient_id, timestamp)
    DB-->>Edge: Audit Entry Committed
    Edge-->>Paramedic: Renders Paramedic Emergency Dossier (Allergies, Full Meds, Contraindications)
